                                    "message":  "docs(release): 0.14.53 release notes, rev5 final public-locator edition (notes commit = last)\n\nReplaces the 1,142 B stub (sha256-16 caf58d91ae965140) with worker-13\u0027s\nlocator-rewritten document, copied byte-for-byte with cp from\n_evidence/dept5-0.14.53-release-integ-20261023/notes/RELEASE_NOTES_0.14.53-PUBLIC.md\n(sha256 be78dc4ae2cd4af7d5e6c83ff97434991d597bf3aa293c5d974753b53b9d0080,\n67,347 B). Not one byte of the text was edited, reflowed or re-wrapped by this\nseat; the working copy\u0027s sha256 was verified against that value before staging,\nand `grep -c /Users/` on it is 0. The stub\u0027s bytes remain the file\u0027s prefix, so\nthe change is a pure insertion of 368 lines.\n\nWhy this file and not the earlier -FINAL.md: the pre-commit gate\n(scripts/secret-scan.sh, fail-closed PUBLIC gate S51) refused that one with\n34 findings = 17 hits x 2 rule classes (PATH + PROFILE), zero secrets, every hit\nan absolute personal path in a citation line (recorded verbatim in\ninteg/NOTES-COMMIT-BLOCKED-2c814093.txt, sha256-16 bfcfa83dc63febb0). The head\nruled the gate right and the locators wrong: worker-13 rewrote the 17 citation\nlocators (repo-relative where the artifact is in the repo; name + sha256 + size\n+ \"internal evidence, not published\" where it is not). worker-5\u0027s independent\nverdict is LOCATOR-ONLY: under normalisation the two files are byte-identical,\nwith 378 lines, 28 citation lines, 162 bullets, 27 headings and 26 UNMEASURED\nlabels across 21 lines on both sides, locators 26 -\u003e 26 substituted, /Users\n26 -\u003e 0, sha tokens 13 -\u003e 39. No sentence deleted, no claim weakened, no\ncitation merged, no UNMEASURED label lost.\n\nConstraint: last commit on work/0.14.53-integ; notes text unmodified by this seat; normal pre-commit hook (no --no-verify); no push, tag, release or upload from this seat\nRejected: committing the refused -FINAL.md | bypassing the hook | rewriting the notes or substituting the paths myself\nDirective: [master] GO 2026-10-25 07:5x - commit RELEASE_NOTES_0.14.53-PUBLIC.md as the LAST commit, report the final tip and the committed file\u0027s sha256\nConfidence: high\nScope-risk: none beyond docs/RELEASE_NOTES_0.14.53.md\nNot-tested: full suites on this final tip (owed under a BUILD GO), Windows build, release.yml\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
